#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/sitemaps.rst:2
msgid "Sitemap support"
msgstr "站点地图支持"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/sitemaps.rst:4
msgid ""
"`Sitemaps <https://www.sitemaps.org/>`__ allow you to inform search engines "
"about URLs that are available for crawling. This makes your content more "
":term:`discoverable <discoverability>`, and improves your :doc:`Search "
"Engine Optimization (SEO) </guides/technical-docs-seo-guide>`."
msgstr ""
"`站点地图 <https://www.sitemaps.org/>`__ 让你向搜索引擎告知可供抓取的 URL。这让你的内容更易被 :term:`发现 "
"<discoverability>` ，并改善 :doc:`搜索引擎优化（SEO） </guides/technical-docs-seo-"
"guide>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/sitemaps.rst:9
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/sitemaps.rst:11
msgid ""
"The ``sitemap.xml`` file is read by search engines to index your "
"documentation. It contains information such as:"
msgstr "搜索引擎读取 ``sitemap.xml`` 文件来索引你的文档。其中包含如下信息："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/sitemaps.rst:14
msgid "When a URL was last updated."
msgstr "URL 最后更新时间。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/sitemaps.rst:15
msgid "How often that URL changes."
msgstr "该 URL 的变更频率。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/sitemaps.rst:16
msgid "How important this URL is in relation to other URLs on the site."
msgstr "该 URL 相对于站点内其他 URL 的重要程度。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/sitemaps.rst:17
msgid "What translations are available for a page."
msgstr "页面可用的翻译。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/sitemaps.rst:19
msgid ""
"Read the Docs automatically generates a ``sitemap.xml`` for your project. "
"The sitemap includes :ref:`public and not hidden versions <versions:Version "
"states>` of your documentation and when they were last updated, sorted by "
"version number."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 会自动为项目生成 ``sitemap.xml`` 。站点地图包含你文档中 :ref:`公开且未隐藏的版本 "
"<versions:Version states>` 及其最后更新时间，按版本号排序。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/sitemaps.rst:23
msgid ""
"This allows search engines to prioritize results based on the version "
"number, sorted by `semantic versioning`_."
msgstr "这让搜索引擎能依据按 `semantic versioning`_ 排序的版本号确定结果优先级。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/sitemaps.rst:27
msgid "Custom ``sitemap.xml``"
msgstr "自定义 ``sitemap.xml``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/sitemaps.rst:29
msgid ""
"You can provide a custom ``sitemap.xml`` file with your docs build output. "
"Read the Docs looks for this file in the **default version** of your "
"project, because ``sitemap.xml`` is served from the root of your docs "
"domain."
msgstr ""
"你可以在文档构建输出中提供自定义 ``sitemap.xml`` 文件。Read the Docs 会在项目的**默认版本** 中查找该文件，因为 "
"``sitemap.xml`` 从文档域名根目录提供服务。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/sitemaps.rst:33
msgid ""
"If this custom file exists, it is served as-is. If it does not exist, Read "
"the Docs serves the generated sitemap instead."
msgstr "若该自定义文件存在，将原样提供；不存在则由 Read the Docs 提供生成的站点地图。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/sitemaps.rst:36
msgid ""
"You can also point crawlers to a different sitemap URL via ``robots.txt``. "
"See :doc:`/reference/robots` for details."
msgstr "你也可以通过 ``robots.txt`` 将爬虫指向其他站点地图 URL。详见 :doc:`/reference/robots` 。"

